The audience thanks the ensemble with a strong applause .
The festival is celebrated in the form of fosters , milling , vinke and conductor Janowski , who conquers himself modestly and forcefully to the Merkel @-@ Kings .
Great applause is given to the festival orchestra , which is showing itself on stage for the first time - in view of the great heat , again in empty leisure clothing .
The performance of Frank Castorf and his team of directors was eagerly awaited .
Had he had to endure a glowing pipe concert in 2013 , there were five years later great rejoicing in which the singular &quot; buh &quot; cries went down .
Katharina Wagner , the festival director , was probably happy about this .
&quot; It is obvious that the audience has grown together with the &quot; Ring , &quot; she said just before the performance of the dpa .
