The Italian authorities had been monitoring the boat of &apos; Jugend Rettet &apos; , the Iuventa , since October .
It is assumed that his crew will take tug boat migrants on board , who will be delivered to them directly by the people @-@ smugglers , and that the smugglers will be able to leave so that the ships can be used again .
