Michelle Carter sentenced for the texts that are driving Conrad Roy to suicide .
A woman from Massachusetts was sentenced to two and a half years for encouraging her boyfriend to commit suicide by means of texts and calls .
Michelle Carter , now 20 , will spend 15 months of her conviction behind bars and five years were suspended in probation .
Carter was sentenced in June for careless killing by Conrad Roy , who took his life on 13 July 2014 .
Roy &apos;s father said at the hearing on Thursday : &quot; My family is uncompromising .
My son was my best friend . &quot;
Carter was allowed to remain free until the appeal .
