&quot; It is a pain that I will always keep with me for the rest of my life , &quot; she said , &quot; I have not had this single person with whom I have been together every day since I was born .
The case seems to set a legal precedent , as there is no law in Massachusetts that makes it a crime to ask another person to commit suicide .
