Judge Moniz said that Carter was looking for attention through the death of Roy and ordered that she should profit from the case by any press .
The case shared the legal opinion .
Among the few who defended Carter was Amanda Knox , who was sentenced in 2007 for murder of her British colleague in Italy before being released two years ago .
Mrs. Knox , 30 years old , published a commentary in the Los Angeles Times : &quot; Michelle Carter deserves compassion and help , not jail . &quot;
