&quot; If the offer comes in , we will expand it .
It is expected that it will be available on many other long @-@ distance lines in Germany in the beginning of next year , &quot; said a speaker from the railroad network .
&quot; Comfort Check @-@ in &quot; is the name of the train &apos;s ticket validation without a master .
To use the software , you need to meet a few requirements : a smartphone or a tablet .
And you have to have booked an online ticket - something most passengers do anyway .
You also need to have it purchased from DB Navigator using the train app , which is the most convenient way to book tickets .
Last but not least , you need to reserve a seat .
The &quot; Comfort Check @-@ in &quot; works like this : you get into the train and call your ticket under &quot; My Tickets . &quot;
A button for electronic devaluation will appear for the test customers .
Train escort will receive a message on their mobile devices that passenger X is in the train and has taken the booked seat Y .
If the train escort comes to Place Y during the ticket inspection , he will know that there is a passenger with an online ticket that has already been validated .
So you can sleep , continue working , stay silent .
The check @-@ in has two advantages : one for the customer , one for the train - which in turn should benefit the passengers .
&quot; If you want to relax without having to check your tickets by our train attendants , just check in in to the DB Navigator .
This allows passengers to personalize their travel time on the train , &quot; says Michael Peterson , marketing director of DB Fernfahrt .
Second plus : &quot; And our employees have more time than they do today to address the individual customer needs . &quot;
Those who travel by train often know that , apart from delays and missed trains , ticket controls are one of the most annoying problems .
Because often you don &apos;t have all the documents you need to validate your online tickets , but in any case one of the passengers does not have it .
Either the credit card or the identity card is missing or a document is required to present .
This results in endless discussions between train companions and passengers , leading to bad mood in the section or large room and delays in the control of your own ticket , and the conductor eventually takes the time to look after other concerns .
At present only a small number of test customers can use the new service .
And this also applies only to the ICE 915 Dortmund @-@ Stuttgart and ICE 912 Stuttgart @-@ Essen connections .
