UCLA will end its practices as soon as the camp is finished , which will not be an easy task , given the clear lines of its fields from an adjacent car park and the adjacent Luskin Center , a hotel of the upper class , which has already been thrown with foot balls that have cleared a protective net behind a door post .
Bruins players are scheduled to occupy the hotel from this weekend , but Mora admitted that there could be a problem if these rooms are vacant during the season .
&quot; We will use our safety , &quot; Mora said .
&quot; This is a real problem and it is not far @-@ fetched to think that people rent a room and then prepare themselves to record an exercise .
If you have the video of an exercise , it is a pretty good deal .
But we have security forces there and we have security forces on parking 8 .
We will do the best with what we have .
I &apos;m not too worried about this .
We have a plan . &quot;
Facebook wants to intensify factual verification in the fight against fake messages
Facebook wants to send more potential articles with false reports to third @-@ party factoring auditors and then display their results under the original post , said the world &apos;s largest online social network on Thursday , it is one of his efforts to fight so @-@ called fake news .
The company said in an opinion on its website that it will begin to use updated machine learning methods to detect possible false reports and to send them to factoring verifiers who may be able to display factual results from the original article .
Facebook has been criticized for being one of the main distribution points for so @-@ called fake news , which many believe influenced the US presidential elections in 2016 .
The issue has also become a major political issue in Europe , with false stories flooding French voters in the run @-@ up to the presidential elections in May , and Germany supports a plan to punish social media networks if they fail to quickly eliminate hateful postings there before the September elections .
On Thursday , Facebook said in a separate statement in German that a test of the new fact review will be launched in the USA , France , the Netherlands and Germany .
&quot; In addition to knowing which stories are challenged by factoring auditors of third parties , people want more context to make informed decisions about what they read and share , &quot; said Sara Su , Product Manager for Facebook messages in a blog .
