Software update for diesel vehicles : What the persons concerned now need to know ?
How exactly is the software update done ?
Do diesel drivers need to participate in the campaign ?
The most important questions and answers in a nutshell .
At the diesel summit BMW , Daimler , Opel and the VW Group offered software updates for a total of around 5.3 million cars .
They are intended to improve the exhaust emissions performance of cars of the Euro 5 and Euro 6 in part .
Euro 4 @-@ Diesel or worse are excluded .
Anja Smetanin of ACE Auto Club Europe gives estimates :
Is the new action obligatory ?
No , the negotiated software updates are voluntary .
&quot; The mandatory updates before apply only to vehicles that have Schummelsoftware , &quot; says Anja Smetanin .
The German Motor Transport Authority ( KBA ) has ordered their retrofitting .
How and when will customers be informed of updates ?
The manufacturers have announced a rapid implementation in the coming months , but have not yet given a precise date .
